       inside each other's stage A buffers, but no edge joins them, so they stay apart. Connector
       St (100-200) makes the two one strongly connected network.
       Expected: build 7 nodes, 6 segments, 12 edges; simplify removes none (101, 201 and 202 end
       ways whose tags differ); stage A no clusters; stage B none; no twins; connectivity keeps
       everything: 7 nodes, 12 edges. -->
